WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Safex

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:13.508
Candy had a great time
on her vacation at Pony's Home.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.847
She came back to the Joseph Hospital
with determination,

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:24.316
and returned to her busy life again.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:37.829
The young lady at the Special-Care ward

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.457
What a beautiful day!

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.119
Candy,
are you done cleaning Room 11?

00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:04.853
Yes, I am, Doctor Frank.

00:01:05.003 --> 00:01:08.090
Bring the medicine
to Room 4 and Room 8.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.724
Also, Room 6 needs a sheet change.

00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:13.360
Three thirty-minute drops for Room 3.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:14.661
Yes, sir!

00:01:14.811 --> 00:01:16.529
And....

00:01:16.679 --> 00:01:19.571
Two-hour nap for Room 5.

00:01:19.721 --> 00:01:21.781
Understood! Is this all?

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:25.541
The dim-wit finally grew up!

00:01:27.354 --> 00:01:29.754
Did the vacation work?

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.289
I look like Franny?

00:01:40.439 --> 00:01:42.163
- Dim-wit!
- Yes!

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.797
You scared me.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.005
You are so mean!

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:56.348
Hey everyone, this is a hospital,
keep quiet!

00:01:56.917 --> 00:01:59.078
Or get out!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:03.415
Candy, keep the patients quiet!

00:02:03.565 --> 00:02:05.013
Yes.

00:02:11.098 --> 00:02:16.191
Franny,
Patty and Stear all wear glasses.

00:02:16.341 --> 00:02:19.462
You are the coldest.

00:02:19.612 --> 00:02:20.965
Dim-wit!

00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:23.097
You don't fool me again!

00:02:23.247 --> 00:02:24.602
For what?

00:02:24.752 --> 00:02:26.070
Headmistress!

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:29.575
What are you talking about?
Dim-wit, you have a letter.

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:34.849
It's your time to take a break.

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:36.248
Yes.

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:39.224
It's from Stear and Archie!

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:54.063
Candy, the month of May is here,
and your birthday is coming.

00:02:54.213 --> 00:02:56.267
Here is a birthday card for you.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.677
It's so pretty! Archie did it!

00:03:01.248 --> 00:03:04.342
I've been so busy that I almost forgot.

00:03:05.619 --> 00:03:08.179
In the month of May it's my birthday!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:16.029
Anthony grew a new kind of rose for me,
Sweet Candy.

00:03:18.532 --> 00:03:21.660
The anniversary of the St. Paul Academy.

00:03:27.107 --> 00:03:28.904
Terry.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:31.507
The first kiss.

00:03:33.747 --> 00:03:37.575
Terry... I try not to think of him.

00:03:37.725 --> 00:03:42.246
I remember his face
whenever people mention about London.

00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:46.623
Where is he right now?

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:49.689
Terry...

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.462
Is that...

00:04:01.775 --> 00:04:03.834
It's coming!

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:11.317
Help!

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.811
What happened?

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:20.787
Are you alright?

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.987
All gone.

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:27.692
Is that you, Stear?

00:04:27.842 --> 00:04:29.227
Candy!

00:04:29.377 --> 00:04:32.635
I found you!
I didn't expect to see you so soon!

00:04:32.973 --> 00:04:35.942
Brother's inventions
always get us in trouble.

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:37.634
Candy!

00:04:37.784 --> 00:04:39.006
Archie!

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:43.012
Is this real? Candy, the white angel!

00:04:43.183 --> 00:04:45.845
Stear and Archie never change.

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:49.511
There are talks
about in Europe about war.

00:04:49.661 --> 00:04:52.250
Grand Aunt Elroy
called us back to America.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:55.152
Annie, Neil, Eliza,
everyone is back!

00:04:55.302 --> 00:04:56.650
And Annie...

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.055
I can breathe the air much better
outside of St. Paul Academy!

00:05:01.205 --> 00:05:05.228
I was not learning much, and trying
to stay there was not helping at all.

00:05:09.176 --> 00:05:12.004
Emergency! I have to go!

00:05:12.279 --> 00:05:15.239
Candy, see you later!

00:05:16.016 --> 00:05:19.917
Archie, Stear, thank you!
I had a great time today seeing you again.

00:05:20.587 --> 00:05:22.075
Do your best, Candy!

00:05:22.225 --> 00:05:23.679
See you again soon!

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:34.758
I'm late! I'm in trouble!

00:05:34.908 --> 00:05:36.032
Dim-wit!

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.499
Headmistress!

00:05:41.649 --> 00:05:45.134
Candice, please take care of the patient
in the Special-Care ward.

00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:46.500
Yes.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.035
The Special-Care ward?
What kind of patient?

00:05:50.185 --> 00:05:53.375
Just came in. Her name is Catherine.

00:05:53.525 --> 00:05:57.747
That little girl... What's her problem?

00:05:57.897 --> 00:06:02.050
I heard it's colic.
Nothing unusual though.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.922
She'll remain in the hospital temporarily.
Please help her.

00:06:06.072 --> 00:06:07.079
Yes.

00:06:12.605 --> 00:06:17.008
The Special-Care ward....
Mr. McGregor was there too!

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:37.888
Why?

00:06:38.038 --> 00:06:41.057
I always believed....

00:06:41.767 --> 00:06:45.359
As long as I did everything
to take care of you well,

00:06:45.509 --> 00:06:47.598
you would be fine.

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:52.168
Mr. McGregor!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:01.009
The Special-Care ward brings me
sad memories.

00:07:01.159 --> 00:07:04.283
Why did they put me here again?

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:08.149
Headmistress Merry Jane
did this on purpose.

00:07:08.299 --> 00:07:12.061
She wanted me to get over my sorrow.

00:07:13.266 --> 00:07:17.358
Listen! Sobbing and crying all day
for a patient,

00:07:17.508 --> 00:07:19.576
being a nurse
is not a right thing for you!

00:07:19.726 --> 00:07:24.472
It is a nurse's job
to deal with separation and death.

00:07:26.912 --> 00:07:28.670
Right!

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:32.615
I'll try my best to help the patients!

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:37.612
You are in charge of Catherine?

00:07:39.325 --> 00:07:42.517
Yes.
I am Candice White, a practice nurse.

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:43.953
Please call me Candy.

00:07:44.103 --> 00:07:46.361
A practice nurse?

00:07:46.665 --> 00:07:49.358
Please don't be worried,
I'll take care of her.

00:07:50.008 --> 00:07:53.662
It is annoying....
What can a practice nurse decide?

00:07:54.312 --> 00:07:57.040
You can talk to me about any problems.

00:07:57.376 --> 00:08:00.837
Listen! She has to practice the piano.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:05.276
The piano? Is practicing the piano
more important than being sick?

00:08:05.726 --> 00:08:07.577
It's not your business.

00:08:07.727 --> 00:08:12.453
You don't understand
how much work I spent on her.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:19.321
Madam wants Miss Catherine
to be the best pianist.

00:08:19.471 --> 00:08:21.088
- Do you understand?
- That's right.

00:08:21.238 --> 00:08:25.034
Catherine is gifted.

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:38.040
Brilliant! She plays like a genius!

00:08:46.758 --> 00:08:49.849
Terrible! I had an appointment
with her piano teacher!

00:08:49.999 --> 00:08:52.686
I have to go back
to discuss the matter with him.

00:08:52.836 --> 00:08:55.489
You! Take good care of her!

00:08:55.639 --> 00:08:56.726
Yes.

00:08:58.503 --> 00:09:02.030
God! I can't believe
there is a mother like this!

00:09:02.841 --> 00:09:05.639
It's such a nice day!
Why didn't anyone open the window?

00:09:12.517 --> 00:09:13.745
Mother...

00:09:14.119 --> 00:09:15.944
You are awake.

00:09:16.494 --> 00:09:17.914
- Where is Mother?
- She just left.

00:09:18.064 --> 00:09:21.352
I am Candy, and I am assigned
to take care of you. Let us be friends!

00:09:22.427 --> 00:09:24.382
No, you need to rest.

00:09:24.532 --> 00:09:26.487
I feel better now.

00:09:27.933 --> 00:09:31.262
It feels so comfortable!
Can I take a walk in the garden?

00:09:36.141 --> 00:09:39.249
I don't understand.
Doctor Frank, what do you think?

00:09:39.449 --> 00:09:41.702
I have no idea, either.

00:09:42.002 --> 00:09:47.983
Nothing unusual, with no pain, either.
Let's keep an eye on her.

00:09:49.087 --> 00:09:51.816
Candy, take her to the garden.

00:09:56.862 --> 00:09:58.455
Candy!

00:09:58.905 --> 00:10:00.455
Candy, get ready!

00:10:00.605 --> 00:10:02.995
Let's go!

00:10:09.508 --> 00:10:12.204
- It's stuck, Candy!
- Ok.

00:10:18.917 --> 00:10:20.641
You are amazing, Candy.

00:10:20.791 --> 00:10:23.511
You got to learn how to climb the tree.

00:10:23.661 --> 00:10:26.022
See!

00:10:26.892 --> 00:10:28.481
Thanks, Candy.

00:10:28.631 --> 00:10:30.390
Candy.

00:10:30.862 --> 00:10:31.816
Yes?

00:10:31.966 --> 00:10:33.986
Is it scary in the tree?

00:10:34.136 --> 00:10:35.221
Not at all.

00:10:35.371 --> 00:10:39.502
It feels very comfortable. It lets you
forget about the worries and troubles.

00:10:41.106 --> 00:10:43.033
You want to try?

00:10:43.675 --> 00:10:45.272
I can't!

00:10:46.144 --> 00:10:50.344
It's ok.
Let me help you, give me your hand!

00:10:52.617 --> 00:10:54.282
Come on!

00:11:13.138 --> 00:11:15.106
Why did you stop?

00:11:15.907 --> 00:11:18.341
- Miss...
- What?

00:11:21.379 --> 00:11:25.112
How is it? Feels good, right?

00:11:34.926 --> 00:11:36.723
Catherine!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:42.130
Letting a patient climb the tree!
What's going on here?

00:11:42.734 --> 00:11:44.793
I made her do it.

00:11:47.005 --> 00:11:49.269
For what?

00:11:49.474 --> 00:11:54.534
Just trying it. Everything is fine,
don't worry about it.

00:11:54.784 --> 00:11:58.440
Just trying it? Catherine is a girl.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.673
How can a girl climb a tree?

00:12:00.823 --> 00:12:03.910
The patients are our concern.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.614
Ok, I understand.

00:12:06.924 --> 00:12:11.554
There are things more important
for Catherine than climbing a tree.

00:12:14.999 --> 00:12:16.757
Sorry.

00:12:16.907 --> 00:12:20.127
But why did you say
you let her climb the tree?

00:12:20.277 --> 00:12:24.600
Your mistake is my responsibility.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.438
Dim-wit!

00:12:30.715 --> 00:12:33.477
Candy, you didn't get fired, did you?

00:12:34.652 --> 00:12:39.446
No, I am fine. The headmistress
took the responsibility for me.

00:12:39.596 --> 00:12:42.316
Her heart is actually much gentler
than what she looks like.

00:12:42.466 --> 00:12:44.218
That's perfect!

00:12:44.568 --> 00:12:46.659
Come in. Slowly.

00:12:47.465 --> 00:12:48.864
Mother.

00:12:53.604 --> 00:12:55.062
Hello.

00:12:55.539 --> 00:12:57.537
What's going on with the piano thing?

00:12:58.242 --> 00:13:01.434
If she can climb a tree,
then she can practice the piano.

00:13:01.584 --> 00:13:03.408
The teacher is here.

00:13:03.718 --> 00:13:06.704
Nonsense! This is the hospital!

00:13:06.854 --> 00:13:11.045
Nonsense? Climbing a tree is nonsense!

00:13:11.622 --> 00:13:14.648
Miss Catherine,
let's practice the listening first.

00:13:17.728 --> 00:13:19.696
Miss Catherine!

00:13:20.164 --> 00:13:21.320
Catherine!

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:23.923
My stomach hurts!

00:13:24.673 --> 00:13:27.202
- Catherine!
- It hurts!

00:13:29.073 --> 00:13:32.000
It's all your fault!
You let her climb the tree!

00:13:35.546 --> 00:13:37.446
Doctor Frank!

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.305
We can stop her pain temporarily.

00:13:51.862 --> 00:13:53.871
How about the piano lesson?

00:13:54.271 --> 00:13:56.274
Of course not!

00:13:56.474 --> 00:13:59.290
What does a practice nurse know?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.629
Of course a practice nurse knows
this kind of thing!

00:14:01.879 --> 00:14:03.629
Shut your mouth, Candice!

00:14:04.079 --> 00:14:06.766
Today she needs to be observed.
Maybe tomorrow.

00:14:06.916 --> 00:14:09.738
Headmistress, is it really a good idea?

00:14:09.888 --> 00:14:12.707
I can't do anything. It's our fault.

00:14:12.857 --> 00:14:14.147
Sorry.

00:14:37.574 --> 00:14:40.068
Good morning, Catherine.
How are you feeling?

00:14:41.311 --> 00:14:42.503
You are here already?

00:14:42.753 --> 00:14:44.476
Stop pretending you don't know.

00:14:44.882 --> 00:14:46.437
What do you mean?

00:14:46.587 --> 00:14:48.313
You know what I am talking about.

00:14:48.986 --> 00:14:50.954
Look at this yourself.

00:14:53.724 --> 00:14:55.624
The strings are broken!

00:14:56.026 --> 00:14:58.824
I want to see the headmistress!

00:15:04.334 --> 00:15:07.826
Is there any proof
that Candice was here early?

00:15:08.205 --> 00:15:10.329
Who else would it be?

00:15:10.479 --> 00:15:11.895
Not me.

00:15:12.045 --> 00:15:14.836
First, you were against the piano
to be moved in.

00:15:14.986 --> 00:15:17.637
I am still against it, and....

00:15:17.987 --> 00:15:20.991
Headmistress, I request someone else
to take care of Catherine.

00:15:21.141 --> 00:15:22.708
Do it right away!

00:15:22.858 --> 00:15:25.288
Ok, I'll do it right away.

00:15:25.789 --> 00:15:27.620
Headmistress!

00:15:28.492 --> 00:15:30.687
Don't talk!

00:15:41.505 --> 00:15:45.034
It's not fair! It wasn't me!

00:15:51.215 --> 00:15:54.446
Who broke the strings then?

00:15:56.186 --> 00:15:59.849
Why did Catherine
suddenly have a stomach ache?

00:16:02.526 --> 00:16:05.188
Come in. Slowly.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:07.590
Right!

00:16:07.831 --> 00:16:12.200
When Catherine saw the piano,
her face became all pale.

00:16:13.503 --> 00:16:18.099
She had a stomach ache
as soon as the piano teacher came.

00:16:19.443 --> 00:16:24.574
The piano must have something to do
with Catherine's illness.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:30.574
Stear was saying...

00:16:30.724 --> 00:16:35.021
I can breathe the air much better
outside of St. Paul Academy!

00:16:35.192 --> 00:16:39.253
I was not learning much, and
staying there was not helping at all.

00:16:39.796 --> 00:16:41.354
Maybe it's...

00:17:09.759 --> 00:17:11.590
It is Catherine!

00:17:12.962 --> 00:17:16.459
Liar!
Catherine wouldn't do anything like this!

00:17:16.866 --> 00:17:22.094
The answer is obvious.
Catherine has some psychological issues.

00:17:22.244 --> 00:17:23.364
Psychological?

00:17:23.714 --> 00:17:27.301
You force her to practice the piano
which she hates.

00:17:27.651 --> 00:17:31.244
The piano she hates?
The piano was her favourite thing.

00:17:31.648 --> 00:17:35.571
No matter how much she liked it,
she was forced to practice it everyday.

00:17:35.721 --> 00:17:37.721
No one would take it.

00:17:38.461 --> 00:17:41.844
That's right. It is exactly
what your daughter's problem is.

00:17:41.994 --> 00:17:45.758
Her unconscious resistance
caused the stomach ache.

00:17:46.295 --> 00:17:50.022
How come
Catherine didn't tell me anything?

00:17:50.172 --> 00:17:54.726
She always listened to me since
she was a kid. She never resisted me.

00:17:54.976 --> 00:17:56.752
She is a good kid.

00:17:57.142 --> 00:18:01.309
She never says anything
because she is afraid to say it.

00:18:02.144 --> 00:18:05.303
Move the piano away right now!

00:18:05.453 --> 00:18:09.783
I can't believe it.
She is such a good kid.

00:18:10.486 --> 00:18:14.578
How did a replaced nurse
come to Catherine's room?

00:18:14.728 --> 00:18:16.381
Isn't this weird?

00:18:16.531 --> 00:18:18.383
That's because Catherine...

00:18:18.833 --> 00:18:20.417
Candice, get out.

00:18:20.567 --> 00:18:22.190
- But...
- Get out!

00:18:26.769 --> 00:18:30.330
Headmistress, it must be her!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.497
No, it's impossible.

00:18:32.647 --> 00:18:34.332
Then, headmistress,

00:18:34.482 --> 00:18:40.045
let me hide
in Catherine's room tonight, ok?

00:18:44.253 --> 00:18:46.011
The piano is still in the room.

00:18:46.161 --> 00:18:49.488
Catherine won't be able
to sleep again tonight.

00:18:50.459 --> 00:18:52.427
Poor Catherine!

00:19:10.379 --> 00:19:12.006
Catherine!

00:19:26.028 --> 00:19:27.655
It truly is her.

00:19:32.534 --> 00:19:36.265
At least I'll take away the piano.

00:19:48.617 --> 00:19:50.180
Catherine!

00:19:54.523 --> 00:19:56.388
Catherine!

00:20:01.063 --> 00:20:02.528
Catherine!

00:20:10.973 --> 00:20:14.631
Poor Catherine, I am sorry!

00:20:14.877 --> 00:20:17.332
Mother is wrong.

00:20:17.482 --> 00:20:21.405
Sorry I let you suffer so much!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.359
Miss Candy.

00:20:40.509 --> 00:20:43.699
Catherine has been out of the hospital
for 3 weeks.

00:20:44.572 --> 00:20:49.530
Today, it is the first time that
she wants to play the piano herself.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.603
The melody is fascinating.

00:20:53.815 --> 00:20:56.340
I was wrong.

00:20:56.785 --> 00:21:00.687
From now on, I'll let Catherine
do only what she wishes.

00:21:01.156 --> 00:21:04.523
It's all because of you!

00:21:05.293 --> 00:21:06.747
This is great!

00:21:06.897 --> 00:21:08.917
The dim-wit did an amazing job!

00:21:09.067 --> 00:21:12.554
Catherine and her mother
regained their health because of this.

00:21:12.704 --> 00:21:13.756
Indeed.

00:21:13.906 --> 00:21:18.430
Candy is growing up,
and she is inspiring.

00:21:19.007 --> 00:21:22.841
Candy successfully helped
Catherine and her mother.

00:21:23.244 --> 00:21:27.112
She is now so happy to be a nurse!
